  "description": "The META POWER TR V4 BOSCH RIDE is ideal for getting started with e-MTB.\n• The 150mm ROCKSHOX 35 Gold fork is easy to adjust. The air spring can be adjusted to any rider weight. The Deluxe Select+ manages the rear suspension with a setting adapted to the frame's kinematics.\n• Braking is handled by SRAM Guide RE 4-piston brakes. They were developed for e-MTB use, and paired with 200mm rotors, braking is powerful and efficient.\n• Wheels are made up of SPANK Spike Race 33 rims mounted on FORMULA hubs specially reinforced for e-MTB use.\n• The SRAM SX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain offers 11-50 gearing. Perfect for steep climbs and varied terrain.",
